      "updated": 1795112824857,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "V4 · Cards. A tile per subscription, three per row at 720 points, two at 480.\nBrings: the price and the deadline read at a glance, like a dashboard. Costs: six to nine\nvisible at once; a long name or deadline wraps.",
      "originalText": "V4 · Cards. A tile per subscription, three per row at 720 points, two at 480.\nBrings: the price and the deadline read at a glance, like a dashboard. Costs: six to nine\nvisible at once; a long name or deadline wraps.",
