      "updated": 1795112824857,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "V5 · To cancel first. What needs an action today, in large with its buttons; the rest quiet below.\nBrings: the first design principle taken literally. Costs: two layouts to code;\nempty when nothing is due (then « Rien à résilier cette semaine »).",
      "originalText": "V5 · To cancel first. What needs an action today, in large with its buttons; the rest quiet below.\nBrings: the first design principle taken literally. Costs: two layouts to code;\nempty when nothing is due (then « Rien à résilier cette semaine »).",
