      "updated": 1795112824857,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "V7 · By time. A strip of the next 60 days, then the subscriptions grouped by when to act.\nBrings: the rhythm of the deadlines in one look. Costs: the strip crowds when many\nfall the same week; a deadline in 8 months sits far down in « Plus tard ».",
